{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life at the Pond</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FROB, you play as the titular frog with a jumpy demeanor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated to keeping his kids (tadpoles) happy and safe, he</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >never strayed too far away from his original harne pond. But</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when those very same tadpoles are taken by a heran, he</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grabs his scarf and bottle to rescue them from the bird's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grasp - only to have a rough landing falling to new</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Small World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across familiar urban and wild</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >landscapes, seen through the perspective of Frob the frog (if</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only there were a term for that). Traverse the gardens of the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suburbs, dense forest thickets, and the claustrophobic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tunnels of the sewers on your way back to the oh-so familiar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pond to confront the heran and save your kids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sticky Situations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a frog tongue at his disposal makes the traversal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the various regions easier than without. Climb, swing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and jump your way to the finish line. Help other slimy and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non slimy creatures alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect every tadpole in each level to get to the next. You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don't want any of them to feel left out, right? On the side are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shiny jewels (caterpillars) to gather and give to a particular</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >moth which lets get some shiny new colors and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to gather shiny jewels (caterpillars). Deliver them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to a particularly stylish moth to get new colors and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >accessories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junior Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started out as a semester project soon evolved into a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >passion project between four game design students.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958200?t=1760377369","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/e66c0fc0cacb307f330334230e8499a842f41e20/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760377369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/3f0d4e30c885de59a3eab11e51956eafecd1c425/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760377369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/3f0d4e30c885de59a3eab11e51956eafecd1c425/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760377369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life at the Pond</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FROB, you play as the titular frog with a jumpy demeanor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated to keeping his kids (tadpoles) happy and safe, he</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >never strayed too far away from his original harne pond. But</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when those very same tadpoles are taken by a heran, he</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grabs his scarf and bottle to rescue them from the bird's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grasp - only to have a rough landing falling to new</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Small World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across familiar urban and wild</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >landscapes, seen through the perspective of Frob the frog (if</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only there were a term for that). Traverse the gardens of the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suburbs, dense forest thickets, and the claustrophobic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tunnels of the sewers on your way back to the oh-so familiar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pond to confront the heran and save your kids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sticky Situations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a frog tongue at his disposal makes the traversal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the various regions easier than without. Climb, swing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and jump your way to the finish line. Help other slimy and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non slimy creatures alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect every tadpole in each level to get to the next. You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don't want any of them to feel left out, right? On the side are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shiny jewels (caterpillars) to gather and give to a particular</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >moth which lets get some shiny new colors and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to gather shiny jewels (caterpillars). Deliver them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to a particularly stylish moth to get new colors and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >accessories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junior Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started out as a semester project soon evolved into a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >passion project between four game design students.</p>","developers":["Team FROB"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/ae90598fc2f84a8a0eb515f351ecf87f4d1c41be/header.jpg?t=1760377369","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958200/1454126881/16a777f75f3a81ce28624b68c5d331c366ae2b88/1759429647/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759932501","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958200/1454126881/16a777f75f3a81ce28624b68c5d331c366ae2b88/1759429647/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759932501","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958200/1454126881/16a777f75f3a81ce28624b68c5d331c366ae2b88/1759429647/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759932501","id":257210965,"name":"MainTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210965/d66234afddc42189cccda2c88c73e211cf944ab2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759932501"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958200/1618847435/811af772f31a7464be8e4c6d7ee0171d81809cdb/1758135896/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759932503","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958200/1618847435/811af772f31a7464be8e4c6d7ee0171d81809cdb/1758135896/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759932503","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958200/1618847435/811af772f31a7464be8e4c6d7ee0171d81809cdb/1758135896/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759932503","id":257200250,"name":"Comic","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572002